                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A typically spontaneous and disorderly outbreak in which food is thrown for amusement, especially across a cafeteria room, as a form of chaotic collective behavior."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ca352d4-7bac-41ae-9208-74eeefc90a59",
                                                "sense_id": "676c2354-6076-34b1-87fd-74dcd8a892f3",
                                                "text": "I got spaghetti sauce all over me during a food fight at lunch today."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32c66f8e-0a35-4829-adf6-5f945db52cc9",
                                                "sense_id": "676c2354-6076-34b1-87fd-74dcd8a892f3",
                                                "text": "“This is going to schism Maga terribly online,” Kirk said. “You're going to see—I don't want to say a Maga civil war, but it's going to be a Maga online food fight that is going to be very hard to navigate.”"
